{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pulls/972","id":5229547095,"node_id":"PR_kwDOR5ZfV88AAAABN7SOVw","html_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pull/972","diff_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pull/972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pull/972.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/issues/972","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pulls/972/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pulls/972/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/issues/972/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile/statuses/43c6b4311f871a0a61768ef90995fce78d74cb79","number":972,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"S177: vista preliminar de los 34 volcanes fuera del NRT","user":{"login":"MendozaVolcanic","id":65313566,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzEzNTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65313566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic","html_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Qué cambia, como fenómeno\n\nHay 34 volcanes que se procesan a diario en sombra y que el operador no podía ver. Esta página los muestra, separada del tablero de los 11, con el rótulo «sin referencia de MIROVA, paridad no medida». Cada detección se separa por distancia al volcán, porque medido del 2026-11-03 al 11-08 hay 22 detecciones (20 focos distintos) y ninguna cae a 5 km o menos: mostrarlas como anomalía del volcán engañaría.\n\n- `frontend/preliminar_34.html` y `frontend/preliminar_34.js`: cumbre (5 km o menos, valor por defecto) o foco lejano. Un solo píxel alertado en la cumbre basta para marcar cumbre. El foco visto desde dos volcanes se marca y se cuenta una vez. Una escena inválida no cuenta como pasada. Si la carga falla, no se muestran cifras en cero.\n- Lee los JSON de `data/sombra_34/` desde el repo público, porque `pages-deploy.yml` saca a propósito las sombras del artefacto.\n- `index.html`: enlace a la vista, sin mover líneas (guard G8). Las tres páginas: «no monitoreado» pasa a «sin datos en este tablero», que vale tanto para un volcán sin publicar como para una carga fallida.\n- Ficha SDA v1.20.\n\nNo toca `pipeline/`, `data/`, `nrt.yml` ni el despliegue. El tablero sigue sin leer la sombra. Tag defensivo `pre-s177-vista-34`.\n\n## Pruebas\n\n- `tests/test_vista_preliminar_34_s177.py`: 20 pruebas sobre el módulo real en node. 11 mutaciones, todas atrapadas por aserción.\n- Navegador local contra los datos reales de `main`: 34 de 34 volcanes, 22 detecciones, 20 focos distintos, 0 en cumbre, sin desborde. Con los datos inaccesibles: 0 cifras, 34 filas «no se pudo cargar» y el aviso.\n- Verificador limpio Sonnet sobre `8e6e6c6d7`: MERGEABLE CON RESERVAS. Atendidos sus hallazgos 1, 2, 3, 4, 6 (escena inválida), 7, 8 y 9, y los dos huecos de prueba. Esta corrección no tuvo una segunda vuelta de verificador.\n\n## Lo que no prueba\n\n- Qué son los focos lejanos sigue SIN VERIFICAR.\n- El radio de 5 km es un valor por defecto, no medido cráter por cráter; 3 detecciones quedan a 5,4 a 5,9 km y se muestran como foco lejano (hallazgo 5, se deja).\n- «sin detección» no mira `celdas_sin_dato`: una escena parcialmente cubierta cuenta como pasada.\n- El script de render de la página se comprobó en navegador, no con prueba automática.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T19:06:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T23:05:06Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T23:05:05Z","merged_at":"2026-11-09T23:05:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"bfab7c8c093faef7b3622bdb82920e7c4a634547","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MendozaVolcanic:claude/s177-vista-34","ref":"claude/s177-vista-34","repo":{"id":1201037143,"node_id":"R_kgDOR5ZfVw","name":"VRP-chile","full_name":"MendozaVolcanic/VRP-chile","owner":{"login":"MendozaVolcanic","id":65313566,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzEzNTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65313566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic","html_url":"https://github.com/MendozaVolcanic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MendozaVolcanic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":fal